  ],
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Before you read another sentence..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 85
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "pause."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 86
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not because this book demands your attention."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 87
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But because your mind has already started judging it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 88
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Without realizing it, you have already begun asking questions."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 89
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "\"Will this book be worth my time?\""
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 90
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "\"Will I agree with it?\""
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 91
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "\"Can it teach me something I don't already know?\""
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 92
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Notice something strange."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 93
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You haven't even entered the book..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 94
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "yet your mind has already created an opinion."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 95
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "That is what the human mind does."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 96
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It predicts before it observes."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 97
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It concludes before it understands."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 98
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It protects before it questions."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 99
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And after enough years..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 100
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "we stop calling this conditioning."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 101
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "We call it our personality."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 102
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Every human being believes they are becoming someone."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 103
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A better version."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 104
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A stronger version."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 105
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A wiser version."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 106
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A happier version."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 107
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "We spend our entire lives chasing a future version of ourselves..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 108
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "without ever asking a terrifying question."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 109
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Who told me that the person I am today is incomplete?"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 110
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Think carefully."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 111
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not emotionally."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 112
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Logically."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 113
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Before you knew language..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 114
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "you had no identity."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 115
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Before you knew your name..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 116
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "you weren't trying to become anyone."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 117
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Before society described success..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 118
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "you never felt behind."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 119
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Before comparison..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 120
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "there was simply experience."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 121
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Then slowly..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 122
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "people handed you definitions."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 123
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This is success."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 124
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This is failure."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 125
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This is beauty."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 126
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This is intelligence."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 127
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This is masculinity."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 128
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This is femininity."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 129
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This is achievement."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 130
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This is respect."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 131
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This is God."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 132
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This is purpose."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 133
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This is love."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 134
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And because you were too young to question them..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 135
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "you accepted them."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 136
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not because they were true."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 137
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because they arrived before doubt did."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 138
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Years passed."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 139
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Those borrowed ideas became your beliefs."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 140
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Those beliefs became your decisions."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 141
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Those decisions became your habits."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 142
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Those habits became your identity."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 143
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And one day..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 144
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "you looked into a mirror..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 145
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "and called all of it"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 146
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "\"Me.\""
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 147
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The most dangerous prison has no walls."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 148
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It has certainty."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 149
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Once you become certain about who you are..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 150
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "growth quietly dies."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 151
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not because truth disappeared..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 152
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "but because questions did."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 153
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Human beings rarely fear death."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 154
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "We fear discovering that the person we spent our entire lives protecting..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 155
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "never truly existed."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 156
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Imagine spending decades defending an identity..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 157
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "only to realize it was built from fear..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 158
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "comparison..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 159
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "approval..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 160
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "memory..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 161
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "and survival."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 162
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Would you call that freedom?"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 163
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Or would you call it a beautifully decorated cage?"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 164
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Your memories feel real."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 165
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Your emotions feel undeniable."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 166
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Your opinions feel original."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 167
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But have you ever wondered why millions of people are equally convinced of completely opposite truths?"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 168
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "How can certainty exist on both sides?"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 169
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because certainty does not prove truth."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 170
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It proves attachment."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 171
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The mind does not seek reality."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 172
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It seeks stability."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 173
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "If reality threatens stability..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 174
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "the mind rewrites reality."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 175
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "That is why two people can experience the same moment..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 176
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "and remember entirely different stories."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 177
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not because memory records life."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 178
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because memory edits it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 179
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Perhaps the greatest illusion is not that we lie to others."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 180
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is that we mistake our explanations for reality."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 181
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Every time life hurts us..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 182
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "the mind rushes to create a story."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 183
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "\"They never loved me.\""
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 184
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "\"I'm not enough.\""
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 185
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "\"People always leave.\""
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 186
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "\"I deserve this.\""
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 187
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "\"I'm different.\""
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 188
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "\"I'm broken.\""
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 189
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "\"They're wrong.\""
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 190
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "\"I'm right.\""
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 191
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Stories."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 192
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Nothing more."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 193
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Yet entire lives are built upon them."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 194
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Careers."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 195
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Relationships."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 196
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Wars."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 197
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Religions."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 198
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Dreams."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 199
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Regrets."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 200
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not because the stories were true..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 201
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "but because they were repeated until they became familiar."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 202
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And familiarity has always disguised itself as truth."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 203
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This book is not asking you to believe anything written inside it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 204
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Belief is easy."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 205
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Questioning is rare."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 206
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Instead..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 207
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I invite you into something far more uncomfortable."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 208
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Observe your own mind while reading."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 209
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Notice the sentences that make you defensive."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 210
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Notice the paragraphs you immediately reject."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 211
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Notice the ideas you desperately want to argue against."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 212
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Those reactions matter more than my words."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 213
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because books never reveal who the author is."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 214
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "They reveal who the reader is."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 215
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Every page becomes a mirror."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 216
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Some people will only see ink."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 217
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Some will see themselves."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 218
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Do not read this book looking for motivation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 219
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Motivation fades."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 220
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Do not read it looking for answers."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 221
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Answers become new beliefs."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 222
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Read it as someone willing to lose certainty."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 223
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because sometimes..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 224
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "the greatest act of intelligence..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 225
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "is not learning something new."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 226
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is realizing that what you have always called yourself..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 227
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "may only be a story that survived long enough to become believable."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 228
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And if that possibility frightens you..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 229
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "good."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 230
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Truth has never been responsible for comfort."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 231
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Only illusion has."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 232
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "So before you turn the page..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 233
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "leave one thing behind."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 234
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The person you are absolutely certain you are."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 235
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because if you cannot question your identity..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 236
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "you will only use this book to strengthen it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 237
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And that would be the greatest misunderstanding of all."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 238
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The pages ahead are not trying to change your life."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 239
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "They are trying to introduce you..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 240
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "to the possibility..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 241
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "that your life has been narrated by a voice you never chose."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 242
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Read slowly."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 243
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Question relentlessly."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 244
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Believe nothing too quickly."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 245
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not even this."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 246
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Especially this."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 247
    }
  ],
